{"a":[244,244],"h":"<p>KIRAET: «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"63\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 63.2 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.7 16.4 25.4 32.2 46.4 53.2\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » Nafi', ibni Âmr, Hamze, Kisâî, halefi Âşir kıraetlerinde «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"20\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 19.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » nın zammiyle, İbni Kesir ve Ebu Ca'fer kıraetlerinde «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"20\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 19.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » nın zammı ve aynın teşdidiyle elifsiz «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"54\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 54.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.8 16.6 23.3 37.6 44.3\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » mütebakisinde «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"20\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 19.9 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.8\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » nın zammiyle «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"63\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 63.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.8 16.6 25.6 32.3 46.6 53.3\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » okunur. «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"45\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 45.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 28.6 35.3\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » Nafi', bezzî, Ebu Bekir Şu'be, Kisaî, Ebu Ca'fer revh kıraetlerinde «sin» yerine «sad» ile okunur.</p><p>Siz bunlardan ibret alıb şükreyleyin 244.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"191\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 191.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 23.3 23.3 23.3 30.0 37.4 53.3 53.3 63.7 70.4 70.4 97.4 108.7 108.7 124.4 131.3 139.4 139.4 146.3 146.3 153.0 159.7 166.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"77.3 77.3 159.7 166.4 174.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve Allah yolunda muharebe edin, vazifenize bakın. -Anlaşıldı ki korkunun ecele faidesi yok, kat'iyen mukadder olanın da reddine çare yok. Ecel geldi ise fisebilillâh ölmek, gelmediyse kıymetli zaferlere nail olub sevablar kazanmak var<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"88\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 87.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 31.6 31.6 31.6 40.6 47.3 47.3 56.3 63.0\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"40.6 63.0 71.3\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve biliniz ki<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"172\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 172.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 25.6 32.3 32.3 39.0 57.0 57.0 66.0 72.8 72.8 102.0 108.8 108.8 108.8 115.6 123.0 138.8 138.8 149.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"39.0 81.8 81.8 102.0 138.8 149.3 156.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Allah muhakkak semi'dir alîmdir.- Gidenlerin ve kalanların ne söylediklerini işidir. Kalblerinde neler gizlediklerini bilir. </p>"}